{
    "title": "Rummy Rush - Classic Card Game",
    "description": "Unwrap the magic of the season playing Rummy Rush!\r\n\r\nDo you love to play classic online card games like Gin Rummy, Rummikub, Kalooki, or other contract rummy games with friends? Then start playing Rummy vs the awesome players from all around the world with the Rummy Rush classic card game NOW!\r\n\r\nRummy Rush is an awesome multiplayer free card game for you and your friends!\r\n\r\nPlay Online Rummy Card Game\r\nYou can think strategically and love to play other classic card games, then RUMMY RUSH is exactly the right card game for you, and it's free.\r\n\r\nDo you know the terms \"Meld\" or \"Going Out\" and know the Rummy rules? Then you will love our multiplayer, classic card game Rummy Rush!\r\n\r\nWould you like to play multiplayer card games online with friends for free? And on top of it, with the online multiplayer version of Rummy Rush, you can play a fun card game with friends anytime, anywhere, and choose several additional modes: Rummy 30, contract rummy, and Rummy 0. \r\n\r\nDo You Like to Play Rummy Card Game or Classic Free Card Games?\r\nPlaying Rush Rummy plus chatting with friends in-game is a great way to play the multiplayer online gaming experience you can have with an online, multiplayer card game!\r\n\r\nDo you know the rules of Rummy well? Join our online gaming community with our free multiplayer Rummy app where you can play online multiplayer card games NOW!\r\n\r\nDo you have what it takes to become a rummy Pro? Join the Rummy club and play the multiplayer online card game Rummy stars plus friends for free to demonstrate your rummy skills in free rummy games live and online.\r\n\r\nOnline Card Games Fan?\r\nBeach Bum, the creative team behind the app, is proud to present you with the awesome rummy app, \"RUMMY RUSH\" with further modes: Rummy 0, Rummy 30, Similar to Scala 40, Remi, Remmy, Scala Quaranta (Scala 40), Kalooki, Romini and Contract Rummy.\r\n\r\nRummy rules are easy to learn, so you can master the full Rummy strategy in no time and enjoy the great online card game with friends or family!\r\nIf you're looking for some online fun, you've come to the right card game! Play Rummy Rush today!\r\n\r\nHow to Play Rummy Card Game \r\nProfessional Rummy players plan their strong strategy and manage \u2018going out\u2019 (Meld All) by keeping track of the Rummy cards that were picked from the table and eliminating the deadwood cards in their hands. Do you have what it takes to be the rummy star?\r\n\r\nRummy Special Features:\r\n\u2660 Enjoy the competitive Rummy experience playing against Rummy players worldwide!\r\n\u2665 Extensive Game Statistics to Keep Track of Your High Rummy scores!\r\n\u2666 Amazing Live User Experience - HD Graphics and a Slick Design\r\n\u2663 Exciting Game Progression, Access New Features as you Level Up!\r\n\u2660 Unlock Challenging Achievements\r\n\u2665 Avatars Creator\r\n\u2666 Free Coin Bonuses Hourly & Daily!\r\n\u2663 Facebook Connect Bonus\r\n\u2660 Seasonal Quests\r\n\r\nLike Backgammon Lord of the Board, Spades Royale, Gin Rummy Stars, and Domino Go - Rummy Rush is a fun, and exciting mobile game developed and distributed free of charge by Beach Bum, the makers of leading online, multiplayer, social, and casual games. \r\n\r\nThis game is only available to users of legal age. Winning any valuable items or money is not possible while playing this game. Additionally, your success in this game does not guarantee success in a comparable real-money casino game.\r\n\r\nFollow us on:\r\nFacebook \r\nInstagram\r\nTiktok\r\nYoutube",
